---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProductGrid from '../components/ProductGrid.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Coleção KZ × ROLEX — Conceito visual não oficial"
	description="Nove edições em um estudo visual não oficial KZ × ROLEX; os acabamentos e valores são conceituais e ilustrativos."
>
	<main class="catalog-page">
		<header class="catalog-heading">
			<p class="eyebrow">KZ × ROLEX · CONCEITO VISUAL NÃO OFICIAL</p>
			<h1>Nove maneiras<br /><em>de ouvir com estilo.</em></h1>
			<p>Acabamentos distintos, da joalheria dourada à precisão do titânio. Encontre a edição que combina com a sua escuta.</p>
		</header>

		<section class="collection-film-track" data-scroll-film aria-labelledby="collection-film-title">
			<div class="collection-film-stage">
				<video class="collection-film-video" data-scroll-film-video muted playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/produtos/mirrored-24k-detail.png" aria-hidden="true">
					<source src="/produtos/Comercial%202.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
				</video>
				<div class="collection-film-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
				<div class="collection-film-copy">
					<p class="eyebrow">KZ × ROLEX · ESTUDO VISUAL NÃO OFICIAL</p>
					<h2 id="collection-film-title">A forma em movimento.<br /><em>A escuta em cada detalhe.</em></h2>
					<p>Um filme para percorrer a coleção antes de descobrir cada edição.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="collection-film-instruction" aria-hidden="true">
					<span>ROLE PARA PERCORRER O FILME</span>
					<strong data-scroll-film-progress>00%</strong>
				</div>
				<div class="collection-film-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span data-scroll-film-progress-bar></span></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="collection-editorial" aria-labelledby="collection-editorial-title">
			<header class="collection-editorial-heading reveal">
				<p class="eyebrow">MATÉRIA · ENGENHARIA · EXPRESSÃO</p>
				<h2 id="collection-editorial-title">Mais do que acabamento.<br /><em>Uma experiência de escuta.</em></h2>
				<p>Um estudo visual sobre o encontro entre design acústico, materiais expressivos e uma escuta de caráter premium.</p>
			</header>
			<div class="collection-editorial-notes reveal-stagger">
				<article style="--reveal-delay: 0ms">
					<span>01 / MATERIALIDADE</span>
					<h3>Presença tátil</h3>
					<p>Reflexos, transparências e contrastes dão identidade própria a cada edição.</p>
				</article>
				<article style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
					<span>02 / ESCUTA</span>
					<h3>Detalhe sonoro</h3>
					<p>Uma intenção de equilíbrio, textura e profundidade — sem alegações ou métricas de desempenho.</p>
				</article>
				<article style="--reveal-delay: 200ms">
					<span>03 / INDIVIDUALIDADE</span>
					<h3>A sua edição</h3>
					<p>Nove interpretações visuais para encontrar a que melhor traduz o seu estilo de escuta.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<ProductGrid showHeading={false} compact={true} />
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.catalog-page { padding-top: 112px; }
	.catalog-heading { width: min(100% - 64px, 1440px); margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 0 26px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-gold-subtle); }
	.eyebrow { margin: 0 0 18px; color: var(--gold-light); font: 10px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .22em; }
	.catalog-heading h1 { margin: 0; color: var(--text-bone); font: 400 clamp(42px, 5.7vw, 72px)/.98 var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; }
	.catalog-heading h1 em { color: var(--gold-light); font: italic 400 1em var(--font-serif); text-transform: none; }
	.catalog-heading > p:last-child { max-width: 560px; margin: 14px 0 0; color: var(--text-sand); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; }
	.collection-film-track { height: auto; }
	.collection-film-track.is-scroll-active { height: 600svh; }
	.collection-film-stage { position: relative; height: min(78svh, 760px); min-height: 560px; overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate; background: #080706; color: var(--text-bone); }
	.collection-film-track.is-scroll-active .collection-film-stage { position: sticky; top: 0; height: 100svh; max-height: 1000px; }
	.collection-film-video, .collection-film-shade { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
	.collection-film-video { z-index: -2; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; }
	.collection-film-shade { z-index: -1; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(5,4,3,.76), rgba(5,4,3,.28) 55%, rgba(5,4,3,.08)), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(5,4,3,.72), transparent 52%); }
	.collection-film-copy { position: absolute; left: max(7vw, calc((100vw - 1440px)/2)); bottom: clamp(110px, 17vh, 190px); width: min(720px, 82vw); }
	.collection-film-copy .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 20px; }
	.collection-film-copy h2, .collection-editorial-heading h2 { margin: 0; font: 400 clamp(42px, 6vw, 82px)/.98 var(--font-display); }
	.collection-film-copy h2 em, .collection-editorial-heading h2 em { color: var(--gold-light); font: italic 400 1em/.98 var(--font-serif); }
	.collection-film-copy > p:last-child { margin: 18px 0 0; color: var(--text-sand); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
	.collection-film-instruction { position: absolute; right: max(7vw, calc((100vw - 1440px)/2)); bottom: 42px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; color: var(--text-sand); font: 9px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .16em; }
	.collection-film-instruction strong { color: var(--gold-light); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; }
	.collection-film-progress { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; height: 2px; background: rgba(245,229,201,.22); }
	.collection-film-progress span { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: var(--gold-light); transform: scaleX(var(--film-progress, 0)); transform-origin: left center; }
	.collection-editorial { width: min(100% - 64px, 1240px); margin: 0 auto; padding: 112px 0 88px; }
	.collection-editorial-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .7fr; align-items: end; gap: 28px 8vw; margin-bottom: 54px; }
	.collection-editorial-heading .eyebrow { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0; }
	.collection-editorial-heading h2 { grid-column: 1; }
	.collection-editorial-heading > p:last-child { max-width: 420px; margin: 0 0 4px; color: var(--text-sand); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; }
	.collection-editorial-notes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-gold); }
	.collection-editorial-notes article { padding: 24px 24px 0 0; }
	.collection-editorial-notes article + article { padding-left: 24px; border-left: 1px solid var(--border-gold-subtle); }
	.collection-editorial-notes span { color: var(--gold-primary); font: 9px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .14em; }
	.collection-editorial-notes h3 { margin: 18px 0 8px; color: var(--text-bone); font: 400 25px var(--font-display); }
	.collection-editorial-notes p { max-width: 340px; margin: 0; color: var(--text-sand); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; }
	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.collection-film-stage { min-height: 480px; }
		.collection-film-track.is-scroll-active { height: 520svh; }
		.collection-film-track.is-scroll-active .collection-film-stage { min-height: 480px; }
		.collection-film-video { object-position: 58% center; }
		.collection-film-shade { background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(5,4,3,.64), rgba(5,4,3,.08)), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(5,4,3,.76), transparent 62%); }
		.collection-film-copy { right: 22px; bottom: 130px; left: 22px; width: auto; }
		.collection-film-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(40px, 11vw, 64px); }
		.collection-film-copy .eyebrow { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .12em; }
		.collection-film-instruction { right: 20px; bottom: 35px; left: 20px; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 8px; }
		.collection-editorial { width: min(100% - 32px, 1240px); padding: 74px 0 64px; }
		.collection-editorial-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
		.collection-editorial-heading .eyebrow, .collection-editorial-heading h2 { grid-column: auto; }
		.collection-editorial-heading h2 { font-size: clamp(40px, 11vw, 60px); }
		.collection-editorial-notes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.collection-editorial-notes article, .collection-editorial-notes article + article { padding: 20px 0; border-left: 0; }
		.collection-editorial-notes article + article { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-gold-subtle); }
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.collection-film-track { height: auto; }
		.collection-film-track.is-scroll-active { height: auto; }
		.collection-film-track.is-scroll-active .collection-film-stage { position: relative; top: auto; height: min(78svh, 760px); min-height: 440px; }
		.collection-film-instruction { display: none; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 600px) { .catalog-page { padding-top: 100px; } .catalog-heading { width: min(100% - 32px, 1440px); padding: 22px 0 18px; } .catalog-heading h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 10vw, 54px); } .catalog-heading > p:last-child { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; } }
</style>
